DESCRIPTION:Topic\n:\nTimeboxing\nSynopsis\n:\nTake charge of your Time wit
	h Him Chuan\nAs a busy executive\, how do you stay resilient and get more 
	done everyday? It’s Time to think inside the Box.\nDiscover the power of
	 timeboxing and how you can use it to unlock your peak productivity. Learn
	 from Him Chuan about the practical tips he uses to prioritize tasks and a
	mplify focus. Build sustainable micro-habits that can help you get more ou
	t of work and life. Register now!\nSpeaker\n:\nHim Chuan LIM\nModerator\n:
	\nJaidev RAM MOHAN\nJoining Instructions\n(via Webex)\n\nJoin via Laptop\n
	\n*As a first time participant using DBS laptop\, you must follow this [
	​mp4 icon]  One Time Webex Setup using DBS Laptop.mp4<https://dbs1bank-m
	y.sharepoint.com/:v:/g/personal/jamesongck_dbs_com/EVcKkn_W6DlCq6ZBNJZMd10
	Bd_0ordpIVCHSxT1Ucjyl6g?e=SzBDh2> guide prior to the event. This will inst
	all Webex Meeting App from DBS Software Centre for optimal streaming exper
	ience!\n\n  1.  On the day of the event\, click on this hyperlink: Webex E
	vents URL<https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/onstage/g.php?MTID=e7716564ccfe56b67db
	b7054a6f359fb0>\n  2.  Enter your First Name\, Last Name\, Email Address a
	nd click on [Join Now]\n\n\nJoin via Mobile Device\n\n  1.  Download Webex
	 Meetings App from Apple App Store or Google PlayStore\nClick on Join Meet
	ing & Input Meeting Number: 2510 686 5933\n\n  1.  Input Password 1234\n\n
	\nJoin via Phone (audio only)\nDial:  +65-3157-6442 (Singapore)\nDial:  +8
	52-3018-6828 (Hong Kong)\nDial:  +91-22-6480-0114 (India-Mumbai)\nDial:  +
	91-40-6480-0114 (India-Hyderabad)\nMeeting Number:  2510 686 5933\nGlobal 
	call-in numbers<https://dbs.webex.com/dbs/globalcallin.php?MTID=e8b348588c
	bf111d8933d1b2e9c4a554e>\n\n\n\n\n\n
